]

These vectors are what the Transformer actually sees.

But Who Decides These Numbers?

Nobody.

Initially:

Kubernetes = [0.31,0.77,0.11]

Random.

During training:

Prediction wrong
↓
Loss calculated
↓
Backpropagation
↓
Adjust vectors slightly
↓
Repeat billions of times

Eventually:

Kubernetes = [0.84,0.72,0.31]
Prometheus = [0.83,0.74,0.29]
Grafana = [0.82,0.70,0.33]

Similar concepts naturally move close together.

